{"id":"conv_03590","context":"Closing remarks at a formal civic gathering, summary recap","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["takeda_officer","asuka_teacher"],"tier":3,"lines":[{"speaker":"takeda_officer","mood":null,"en":"Everyone, despite your busy schedules, thank you sincerely for gathering today.","jp":"皆様、本日におきましてはご多忙にもかかわらずお集まりいただき、誠にありがとうございました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,3,8,11,14,28,39,56,94,492,525,787,944,1405,1429,1696,2146,3859,4769,4781,4982,5401,7865,8157,8195,11389,16797],"jpTokens":[{"s":"皆様","r":"みなさま","w":1405},{"s":"、"},{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"におきまして","w":1696},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"ご多忙","r":"ごたぼう"},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"かかわら","w":4982},{"s":"ず","w":525},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"集まり","r":"あつまり","w":3859},{"s":"いただき","w":1429},{"s":"、"},{"s":"誠に","r":"まことに","w":7865},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"On the contrary, it is my honor to hear such valuable talks at this civic hall.","jp":"こちらこそ、この市民会館にて貴重なお話を伺えて光栄でございます。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,5,14,21,31,94,359,553,730,986,2538,2973,4998,9920,13747],"jpTokens":[{"s":"こちら","w":359},{"s":"こそ","w":553},{"s":"、"},{"s":"この","w":31},{"s":"市民","r":"しみん","w":986},{"s":"会館","r":"かいかん","w":4998},{"s":"にて","w":2973},{"s":"貴重","r":"きちょう","w":2538},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"お話","r":"おはなし","w":730},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"伺え","r":"うかがえ"},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"光栄","r":"こうえい","w":13747},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"takeda_officer","mood":null,"en":"To restate the key points, each municipality will cooperate and work to enhance regional safety.","jp":"改めて要点を申し上げますと、各市町村が連携し、地域の安全を高めるべく取り組んでまいります。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,5,6,7,9,14,19,288,545,590,680,1434,1733,1995,2335,2445,2475,2606,3030,3759,4322,4710,5183,5571,6424,7784,11667,12762,12763],"jpTokens":[{"s":"改めて","r":"あらためて","